## Source code of the GPL programs inside the program (written offer)

iPXE (both the unsigned builds and the iPXE project's signed build), wimboot and Canonical's signed GRUB (below) are GPL programs that are part of the Gola Bootlace program as
files, and so is the iPXE project's signed shim (BSD-2-Clause, below), whose source is delivered the same way. Their source code, exactly as it was when they
were shipped, is attached to every release as `bootlace-<version>-third-party-sources.tar` (the files and where each comes from are listed, with checksums, in
`third_party/SOURCES`). Whoever has received the program in any other way can ask for it: open an issue in the repository, or write to Gola Services through https://gola.tn.
This offer is valid for at least three years after the version in question was last offered.

